<view class="page">
  <view class="profile">
    <view class="logo">🧾</view>
    <view class="profile-main">
      <text class="name">拾光账本本</text>
      <text class="tagline">把每一笔，记成生活的样子</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="stats-card">
    <view class="stat">
      <text class="stat-num">{{recordCount}}</text>
      <text class="stat-label">累计笔数</text>
    </view>
    <view class="stat">
      <text class="stat-num">{{days}}</text>
      <text class="stat-label">记账天数</text>
    </view>
    <view class="stat">
      <text class="stat-num">¥{{totalText}}</text>
      <text class="stat-label">累计支出</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card budget-card">
    <view class="card-head">
      <text class="card-title">月预算</text>
      <text class="card-sub">用于首页进度提示，留空表示关闭</text>
    </view>
    <view class="budget-row">
      <text class="cny">¥</text>
      <input class="budget-input" type="digit" value="{{budget}}" placeholder="0"
             placeholder-class="ph" bindinput="onBudgetInput" />
      <view class="save-mini" bindtap="saveBudget" hover-class="soft-hover">保存</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card skin-card">
    <view class="card-head">
      <text class="card-title">桌宠换肤</text>
      <text class="card-sub">点一下就能换</text>
    </view>
    <view class="skin-grid">
      <view class="skin-item {{item.id === skinId ? 'on' : ''}}"
            wx:for="{{skins}}" wx:key="id"
            data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="pickSkin" hover-class="skin-hover">
        <image class="skin-img" src="{{item.src}}" mode="aspectFit" />
        <text class="skin-name">{{item.name}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="skin-item {{skinId === 'custom' ? 'on' : ''}}"
            bindtap="pickCustomSkin" hover-class="skin-hover">
        <view class="skin-plus">＋</view>
        <text class="skin-name">自定义</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <text class="skin-tip">内置皮肤为手绘小猫；自定义图片会以圆形头像展示，建议选主体清晰、背景干净的图。图片只保存在你手机本机。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card menu">
    <view class="menu-item" bindtap="goImport" hover-class="menu-hover">
      <text class="menu-icon">📥</text>
      <text class="menu-text">批量导入账单</text>
      <text class="menu-arrow">›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="menu-item" bindtap="exportData" hover-class="menu-hover">
      <text class="menu-icon">📋</text>
      <text class="menu-text">导出数据到剪贴板</text>
      <text class="menu-arrow">›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="menu-item" bindtap="clearAll" hover-class="menu-hover">
      <text class="menu-icon">🗑️</text>
      <text class="menu-text danger">清空所有记录</text>
      <text class="menu-arrow">›</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card about">
    <text class="card-title">自动归类规则</text>
    <text class="about-text">根据备注里的关键词自动判断分类：「午饭、外卖、咖啡」→ 餐饮，「地铁、打车、加油」→ 交通，「房租、电费、话费」→ 居住。识别不到时归入「其他」，记账时可以随时手动改。</text>
    <text class="about-text muted">数据只保存在本机微信的本地缓存中，不会上传到任何服务器。清除小程序缓存会删除记录，建议定期导出备份。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="version">拾光账本本 v{{version}}</view>
</view>
